  "hard-gates-precede-soft-scores": {
   "statement": "Eligibility — applicant type, geography, award-size capacity, deadline — is decided by deterministic checks that no scoring model may override. Fit is argued only after eligibility passes; a beautifully matched application the applicant may not submit is worth nothing.",
   "techniques": [
